            <div style="font-family:'GT Flexa Extended','GT Flexa','Barlow Condensed','Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#00A1C4;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.5;"></div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#1E293B;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;">Dear Investor,</div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#1E293B;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">Taranis Market Sentiment</span> ended the month of <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">July 2026</span> with a net performance of <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">-12.7%</span>.</div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:#334155;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;margin-bottom:12px;">The <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">systematic strategy brought stability</span> thanks to our U.S. index exposure, while our <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">tech long/short book lost</span> in a severe rotation out of growth. The Nasdaq's <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">-6.6%</span> understates the month: on down days alone the index fell <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">15.8% cumulatively</span>, against 11.0% gained on up days.</div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:#334155;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;margin-bottom:12px;">The correction was triggered notably by the <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">Korean market</span>, where a record <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">3.4% of the adult population received margin calls</span>, and by the <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">Situational Awareness fund's 67% loss</span>, which forced it to unwind much of its public-equity portfolio and pressured AI infrastructure names.</div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:#334155;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;margin-bottom:12px;"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">Shorts in semis, notably Mobileye</span>, software longs and our <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">GARP holdings</span> cushioned the book. We also <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">increased hyperscaler exposure following Alphabet and Microsoft earnings</span>, now <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">11% of the long book</span>.</div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:#334155;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;margin-bottom:12px;">Fundamentals remain intact: <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">multiple compression despite solid performance</span>, with earnings revised up <span style="font-weight:700;color:#1E293B;">+14% for 2026</span>. We still see room for growth stocks to outperform going forward.</div>

            <div style="font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','aktiv-grotesk','Helvetica Neue','Arial',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:#334155;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;">Please, find our Taranis Market Sentiment monthly report for July 2026 by <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cv_U70VZ48ru4QNxEKXPJTVy0lhP8Jt9/view?usp=sharing" style="color:#0066cc;text-decoration:underline;">clicking here</a>.</div>

